---
title: How to fix a damaged PDF
description: Repair broken PDF structure in your browser — rebuild pages without uploading.
relatedTool: fix-pdf
---

Some PDFs fail to open because of broken cross-reference tables or bad incremental updates. Fix PDF rebuilds a clean document from readable pages.

## Steps

1. Open **Fix PDF**.
2. Upload the damaged file.
3. Click **Fix PDF** — pages are copied into a fresh structure.
4. Download the repaired file and open it in your viewer.

## Tips

> **Warning:** If the page content itself is unreadable, repair cannot invent missing data. Try Fix PDF first; if that fails, re-export from the original app.

